Trauma (D10)

Roll on the Negative Traits table.

The extreme nervousness you feel just makes

things worse. Gain 5 permanent Stress.

Your shaking hands can barely hold a thing.

Take -1 to either Close Combat or Ranged Combat.

Distracted by shadows, you can't focus on

anything. Take -1 Perception.

Your heart is fluttering and you have problems

breathing. Take -1 Stamina.

You feel as if something broke inside of you.

Take -1 WIL.

You hyperventilate when you enter combat,

immediately expending 1 x Oxygen pellet.

Stressful situations fill you with a deep anxiety

that can only be suppressed with physical pain.

Each time you gain stress, receive 1 Wound.

This stress is so intense that you suffer a

heart attack. Pass a CON check or die.

